amp-panel (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial pre-release of the optical equipment control panel.
  * Run one optical amplifier and one FTS-LS station view concurrently, with
    independent live state, SQLite history, hourly statistics, and CSV export.
  * Acquire and control the amplifier over serial. Keep FTS-LS read-only until
    the external station daemon XML interface is defined.
  * Provide authenticated web access, SNMP, syslog, and service and network
    diagnostics.
  * Package the application and its Python dependencies for systemd, with
    Chart.js bundled locally for offline operation.

 -- Michał Surówka <msurowka@student.agh.edu.pl>  Mon, 14 Sep 2026 13:15:36 +0200
